  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tdataset used for ozut! research project\n\t\n\nParsed osu! beatmaps, normalized metadata, hit objects, timing/control points,\ndifficulty attributes, individual Opus audio, and raw .osu content in Parquet.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSnapshot\n\t\n\n\nAPI beatmaps: 226,211\nParsed .osu files: 223,879\nParsed hit objects: 146,590,368\nArtifact files: 283,841\nArtifact payload: 181.98 GiB\nIndividual Opus files: 59,962\nApproximate Hub files: 59,980\nParser: rosu-map 0.2.1\nDifficulty calculator: rosu-pp 4.0.1\n\nExact\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ggmolly/ozut-data.",
